    "Bare clones are stored under ~/.local/share/gitrelay/mirrors/. When over quota, GitRelay runs git gc on least-recently synced mirrors first, then deletes entire clones if needed. The next sync rebuilds deleted mirrors.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bare clones are stored under ~/.local/share/gitrelay/mirrors/. When over quota, GitRelay runs git gc on least-recently synced mirrors first, then deletes entire clones if needed. The next sync rebuilds deleted mirrors."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bare 克隆保存在 ~/.local/share/gitrelay/mirrors/。超出配额时，GitRelay 会先对最久未同步的镜像执行 git gc，必要时再删除整个克隆；下次同步会自动重建。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
