    "Sync immediately after receiving a verified push event, independent of the frequency schedule. Enable the local listener in Settings → Webhook. Cloudflare Tunnel or Tailscale Funnel can optionally provide external access.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
